 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Menon, hello. This is your six-week check on the knee, I believe. And you've brought your daughter?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'm Priya, I wanted to hear what the doctor says. He doesn't tell me everything. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I tell her enough. The knee is better, doctor, but stiff."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How stiff?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "In the mornings, I cannot bend it fully until about nine o'clock."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And it swells in the evening, doctor, he puts his foot up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain or swelling in the calf?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No pain in the calf, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, four times a day. And aspirin, 150 mg, once a day, for the blood clots."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Your other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, and arthritis in the other knee."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Temperature 36.8, blood pressure 130 over 78.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is he all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very good. I won't put a label on anything today, he's doing as expected. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How's the physiotherapy? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Twice a week. The exercises at home, I do them every day. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He does, I watch him. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep doing them. They matter more than any tablet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How is your sleep? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The knee wakes me if I turn onto it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A pillow between the knees helps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will try. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the knee, to see that everything is sitting well."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Before your next visit. I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Six weeks. I'll bring him. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
